# UBSan's suppressions for the pc platform (docs/platforms.md,
# "Sanitizers"): UBSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=platform/pc/ubsan.supp.
# A line `CHECK:PATTERN` drops CHECK's reports in the functions (or source
# files) PATTERN names; nothing else is dropped.
#
# PlayCutscene (engine/src/game/level/level_cutscene.cpp) hands
# SetSlideshowDispcnt `*(u32 *)dispcnt`: 4 bytes of the 2-byte
# Display::dispcnt, as the ROM reads it (an `ldr`). Only the low halfword
# is used (gSlideshowDispcnt's, written to REG_DISPCNT), so the read is
# left as the ROM has it, and only its object-size report is dropped.
object-size:Game::Level::LevelState::PlayCutscene

# N. Gin's airship and hovercraft (Airship::ConvertTiles,
# airship_graphics.cpp; Hovercraft::ConvertTiles, hovercraft.cpp) walk
# their picture's frames from the palette's address + 0x204: the picture
# right after the 512-byte palette, back to back as in the ROM
# (boss_pictures.cpp). The reads are past the palette object, and only
# their object-size reports are dropped.
object-size:Game::Vehicles::Jetpack::Airship::ConvertTiles
object-size:Game::Bosses::Hovercraft::ConvertTiles
